{"availability":"available","full":"npmaiecosystem/npmai-agent","name":"npmai-agent","description":"npmai-agent (internally known as the npmai-agent-suite) is a production-grade AI agent framework built on top of the NPMAI ECOSYSTEM.It gives any Python developer a fully autonomous, multi-LLM agentic pipeline with 1371 integrated tools 100 classes,orchestrated by a five-role LLM pipeline (Planner → Tool_manager  → Coder → Auditor → Verifier).","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":4,"created":"2026-06-07T11:07:15Z","updated":"2026-10-09T05:22:36Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://npmai.netlify.app","topics":["agent","agentic-ai","ai","mcp","mcp-server","mcp-tools","npmai","npmai-ecosystem","pypi-package","tools"],"demo":"https://npmai.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:08:04.526Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:08:04.526Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:08:04.526Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:08:04.526Z","stars":3,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🌐 Website · 📦 PyPI · 🐙 GitHub · 👤 Founder . [](","npmaiagents is a production-grade, open-source autonomous AI agent framework with 1,371 verified tools across 100 classes — the largest open-source local tool registry ever built. A 5-role LLM pipeline (Planner → Tool Manager → Coder → Auditor → Verifier) autonomously executes any plain-English task on your computer using 12 supported LLM providers including NPMAI free LLMs, OpenAI, Groq, Anthropic, Gemini, and more.","The core insight: LLMs waste most of their context reverse-engineering API documentation instead of solving your actual problem. Every class in npmaiagents ships a use variable — pre-compiled, structured tool knowledge that the pipeline reads on-demand. The Planner sees a one-line index of all 100 classes. The Tool Manager drills into full documentation only for classes the task actually needs. The Coder receives exact method signatures and call examples. Zero hallucination on API shapes. Maximum intelligence on task logic."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npmaiecosystem/npmai-agent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"19b4a7c35470a0cf49cc7f897b2803df0b356d158115103db56aea08712a2558","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:08:04.636Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:08:04.636Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"🌐 Website · 📦 PyPI · 🐙 GitHub · 👤 Founder . [](","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npmaiecosystem/npmai-agent/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"19b4a7c35470a0cf49cc7f897b2803df0b356d158115103db56aea08712a2558","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npmaiecosystem/npmai-agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:08:04.638Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T05:22:36Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npmaiecosystem/npmai-agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:08:04.641Z","hash":"19b4a7c35470a0cf49cc7f897b2803df0b356d158115103db56aea08712a2558","originalBytes":104631,"storedBytes":104631,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["list","get","create","npmai","path","tools","name","key","python","output","file","import","add","agents","sonu","home","update","delete","task","run","generate","data","image","method","project","send","email","purpose","customer","parameters","role","set","invoice","tool","export","text","payment","remove","repo","search","check","code","api","title","bucket","namespace","cwd","default","input","report","build","install","product","save-credentials","value","chart","template","type","dir","folder","model","owner","query","files","order","str","video","csv","description","info","issue","local","package","start","amount","bash","branch","command","contact","event","extract","function","open","pipeline","record","service","audio","find","workspace","convert","llm","message","read","status","system","dict","env","manager","m